From e622dd3f4198d5a42d0e0b2a58bc5ed127a97de7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:04:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-234: perf log shows where the frame goes outside
 the world, and each addon's Lua CPU

- New stages: uiUpdate (CSimpleTop::OnLayerUpdate), uiRender (OnLayerRender), present (GxScenePresent, VSync and
  maxFPS wait included), luaEvents (outermost FrameScript_SignalEvent; depth kept in the perf module and reset each
  frame, as a Lua error can leave by longjmp past the destructor)
- outside_ms line: ui_update, ui_draw (UI render less the world inside it), present_wait, other, lua_events
- addons_ms line: per-addon ms/frame from the client's own profiler (scriptProfile 1 + /reload), heaviest 15

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UHcJJVC4feQ4s15e9bNRoN
